title: "HCLR: Human Cognitive Leverage Ratio — A Method for AI Users to Assess Their Influence on Model Outputs"
abstract: "A self-assessment method for AI users. HCLR records the process from an initial AI output (O0) through sparse human interventions (h) to a final deliverable (O1), with double confirmation (C1 adoption, C2 audience recognition)."
